{"id":"000W79","title":"Cobra Kai (ft. Agent)","author":"the_cogito","solvedCount":3,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-24T02:16:37+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 20:59 Uhr","rules":"As part of a collaboration event run by mnasti, I had the pleasure of being randomly paired up with Agent! We were tasked with building an ambiguous puzzle of some sort, but neither of us knew we were setting with each other. It was fun, and I think what we came up with turned out pretty great, I hope you like it!\n\nRules:\n\n- Normal Sudoku rules apply.\n\n- Draw a one-cell-wide snake of orthogonally connected cells. The snake may not touch itself orthogonally, but may touch diagonally. Given circles are the endpoints of the snake.\n\n- Identify two teams of digits, A and B. All occurrences of the same digit belong to the same team. Adjacent cells along the snake must belong to different teams.\n\n- The number in the top-left corner of a cage indicates EITHER the sum of team A digits OR the sum of team B digits in that cage, and also indicates the sum of digits on the snake in that cage. Digits cannot repeat in cages.\n\nSolve on SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Row 9 followed by column 7 (18 digits, no spaces)","tags":["Sudoku","Killer (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/d7vxzfherv","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/d7vxzfherv","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":11,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-24T02:16:37+00:00"}